{title: Yes Lord}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Yes Lord.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Yes Lord, yes Lord
From the bottom of my heart to the depths of my soul
Yes Lord, completely yes
My soul says yes

{comment: Chorus 2}
I love You, I love You
From the bottom of my heart to the depths of my soul
I love you, I really do
My soul loves You
